{"1977100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Timeless Heart VR", "steam_appid": 1977100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Community and Playtest</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/79c219052ce1ab8173ad618317401549.poster.avif?t=1774859965\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/79c219052ce1ab8173ad618317401549.webm?t=1774859965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/79c219052ce1ab8173ad618317401549.mp4?t=1774859965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Join our Discord to chat with the developers, or participate in the Steam discussions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback is very important to us!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timeless Heart VR</strong> is a story-driven VR action adventure game. Journey alongside Lycaena through four kingdoms frozen on the eve of destruction, and uncover the truth through cooperative combat, elemental reactions, and repeated returns. Fight in close quarters with a variety of weapons, use your Chain Claw for high-speed movement and evasive maneuvers, and exploit environmental objects to break enemy weak points. Reaching the end once does not mean it is truly over. Only by challenging fate again can you reach the final answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not fighting alone.<br>Real-time cooperative combat alongside Lycaena is at the heart of <strong>Timeless Heart VR</strong>. She fights in different armored job forms, each with its own unique abilities, attributes, and combat style. You must cover each other, attack together, and adapt to the changing flow of battle to execute both offense and defense in real time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real-Time Cooperative Combat with Lycaena</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alongside Lycaena in real time, covering each other and attacking together as the battle shifts moment by moment. She takes the field in different armored job forms, each with distinct abilities, attributes, and combat styles, creating a wide range of cooperative possibilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/6f94afc971a7259b60224ee2a288a937.poster.avif?t=1774859965\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/6f94afc971a7259b60224ee2a288a937.webm?t=1774859965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/6f94afc971a7259b60224ee2a288a937.mp4?t=1774859965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Variety of Weapons and Visceral VR Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a range of distinctive weapons, each with its own attack rhythm, handling, and impact. With more physical, involved motion controls and direct hit feedback, every strike feels weighty, satisfying, and immersive in close-range combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/b6f59ff5fa54f7646eae0bd8ec301ab7.poster.avif?t=1774859965\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/b6f59ff5fa54f7646eae0bd8ec301ab7.webm?t=1774859965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/b6f59ff5fa54f7646eae0bd8ec301ab7.mp4?t=1774859965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chain Claw Mobility, Environmental Interaction, and Weak Point Destruction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your Chain Claw for rapid movement and evasive jumps, seize special objects in the environment, and throw or use them to break enemy weak points, adding mobility, interaction, and tactical depth to every fight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/2534c63dfcc6096f8a88682101b29a0b.poster.avif?t=1774859965\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/2534c63dfcc6096f8a88682101b29a0b.webm?t=1774859965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/2534c63dfcc6096f8a88682101b29a0b.mp4?t=1774859965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Interwoven Elemental Reaction System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine Lycaena’s armored job attributes with the player’s weapons to create diverse elemental interactions, constantly generating new reactions and tactical possibilities in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/30b8fea62ecf8916d495ba14f26d675b.avif?t=1774859965\" width=600 height=2063 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ever-Changing Kingdom Structures and Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge ever-changing kingdom layouts that keep exploration fresh, unpredictable, and replayable with every journey.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/e401799f1d28be2a8dadd78ab46c326d.avif?t=1774859965\" width=1560 height=839 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lounge Interactions and Cooking-Based Growth System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond battle, unwind through small interactive details in the lounge, and grow stronger through cooking and eating as part of your adventure.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/eaebf3320318c572571e719f4acbee7d.avif?t=1774859965\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Looping Progression and Multi-Stage Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reaching the end once is not the true end. Through repeated challenges, returns, and progression, you will gradually draw closer to the final answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/2384949214132e7a0360856b5ea3f9cd.avif?t=1774859965\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Let me guess... You're at a point where you don't remember me, right?&quot;</i><br><i>&quot;The time here is chaotic, maybe we've already met at some point in the future.&quot;  </i> <br><i>&quot;Or perhaps we've already had some interaction in the past?&quot;</i> <br> <i>&quot;Welcome to the cage of time and space, lost traveler.&quot;</i> <br> <i>&quot;Let's get along as fellow prisoners.&quot;  </i><br> <i>——Lycaena</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/27d34974423b77efd7c38bf77438ace8.avif?t=1774859965\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;I am Amadeus, the guardian of this space. &quot;</i><br> <i>&quot;I advise you to halt here. Cease from further destabilizing this realm.&quot;</i> <br> <i>&quot;But alas, it has come to this point, and I suppose you won't heed my words.&quot; </i> <br><i>——Amadeus</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i><br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/fc224b64fc6de4db22eccc28ff90008f.avif?t=1774859965\" width=256 height=256 /></span><i> </i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;I have been waiting for a long time, My Lord. Have you finally responded to me?&quot;</i><br> <i>&quot;Ah, I see... Weren't you the deities guarding this land?&quot;</i> <br> <i>&quot;It seems my prayers were not devout enough.&quot;</i> <br> <i>——Aurora</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/7568d155ae9e7ff45eb5315ee86dc92f.avif?t=1774859965\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Hello, lost traveler, and this beautiful lady.&quot;</i> <br> <i>&quot;I am Cyrus, the captain of the Imperial Knight Order. It seems like I've lost an important memory.&quot;</i> <br> <i>——Cyrus </i><br> <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/1d1747c2d0c01b09e42d3df483698017.avif?t=1774859965\" width=400 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Please remember this no matter what.&quot;</i><br> <i>“This is by no means a journey of despair.“</i> <br> <i>“The wills you encounter will be with you.”</i> <br> <i>“Toward the tomorrow you hope for.”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i><br> <i>“To Recreate this 'World'.”</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timeless Heart VR</strong> is a story-driven VR action adventure game. Journey alongside Lycaena through four kingdoms frozen on the eve of destruction, and uncover the truth through cooperative combat, elemental reactions, and repeated returns. Fight in close quarters with a variety of weapons, use your Chain Claw for high-speed movement and evasive maneuvers, and exploit environmental objects to break enemy weak points. Reaching the end once does not mean it is truly over. Only by challenging fate again can you reach the final answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not fighting alone.<br>Real-time cooperative combat alongside Lycaena is at the heart of <strong>Timeless Heart VR</strong>. She fights in different armored job forms, each with its own unique abilities, attributes, and combat style. You must cover each other, attack together, and adapt to the changing flow of battle to execute both offense and defense in real time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real-Time Cooperative Combat with Lycaena</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alongside Lycaena in real time, covering each other and attacking together as the battle shifts moment by moment. She takes the field in different armored job forms, each with distinct abilities, attributes, and combat styles, creating a wide range of cooperative possibilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/6f94afc971a7259b60224ee2a288a937.poster.avif?t=1774859965\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/6f94afc971a7259b60224ee2a288a937.webm?t=1774859965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/6f94afc971a7259b60224ee2a288a937.mp4?t=1774859965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Variety of Weapons and Visceral VR Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a range of distinctive weapons, each with its own attack rhythm, handling, and impact. With more physical, involved motion controls and direct hit feedback, every strike feels weighty, satisfying, and immersive in close-range combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/b6f59ff5fa54f7646eae0bd8ec301ab7.poster.avif?t=1774859965\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/b6f59ff5fa54f7646eae0bd8ec301ab7.webm?t=1774859965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/b6f59ff5fa54f7646eae0bd8ec301ab7.mp4?t=1774859965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chain Claw Mobility, Environmental Interaction, and Weak Point Destruction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your Chain Claw for rapid movement and evasive jumps, seize special objects in the environment, and throw or use them to break enemy weak points, adding mobility, interaction, and tactical depth to every fight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/2534c63dfcc6096f8a88682101b29a0b.poster.avif?t=1774859965\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977100/extras/2534c63dfcc6096f8a88682101b29a0b.webm?t=1